{
  "$schema": "https://ui.shadcn.com/schema/registry.json",
  "name": "jhai-base",
  "homepage": "https://github.com/JustinHarrisAI/jhai-registry",
  "items": [
    {
      "name": "theme-base",
      "type": "registry:base",
      "title": "JHAI Theme Base",
      "description": "The JHAI token chain in one stylesheet: the --jh-* brand layer, the shadcn semantic mapping, the v2 vocabulary, and the Tailwind projection. Install this first; every other @jhai item assumes it. Rebrand by overriding --jh-* only.",
      "author": "Justin Harris <justin@justinharris.ai>",
      "categories": [
        "theme",
        "tokens"
      ],
      "files": [
        {
          "path": "theme-base/jhai-theme-base.css",
          "type": "registry:file",
          "target": "src/styles/jhai-theme-base.css"
        }
      ],
      "docs": "Add ONE line to your globals.css, immediately after the tailwind import:\n\n    @import \"tailwindcss\";\n    @import \"../styles/jhai-theme-base.css\";\n\nAdjust the relative path to wherever the file landed. To rebrand, append a :root block AFTER that import overriding only --jh-* values — see the CLIENT REBRAND block at the foot of the file.\n\nThe shadcn semantic tokens (--background, --foreground, --primary, --border and the rest) are NOT in that CSS file. They arrive as cssVars, which the CLI merges into your project's own :root block. That is deliberate: your :root is declared later in globals.css than the @import, so a mapping inside the file would render correctly on a bare project and silently lose on a real shadcn one.\n\nDo not edit any --ink-*, --paper-*, --bjarmi-* or shadcn semantic token directly. They resolve through --jh-* and editing them breaks the chain.",
      "meta": {
        "upstream": null,
        "upstreamLicense": null,
        "jhaiVersion": "1.0.0"
      },
      "cssVars": {
        "light": {
          "background": "var(--jh-bg)",
          "foreground": "var(--jh-text)",
          "card": "var(--jh-surface)",
          "card-foreground": "var(--jh-text)",
          "popover": "var(--jh-surface)",
          "popover-foreground": "var(--jh-text)",
          "primary": "var(--jh-accent)",
          "primary-foreground": "var(--jh-accent-contrast)",
          "secondary": "var(--jh-surface)",
          "secondary-foreground": "var(--jh-primary-deep)",
          "muted": "var(--jh-surface-strong)",
          "muted-foreground": "var(--jh-text-muted)",
          "accent": "var(--jh-surface-strong)",
          "accent-foreground": "var(--jh-text)",
          "destructive": "var(--jh-status-alert)",
          "border": "var(--jh-border)",
          "input": "var(--jh-border-mid)",
          "ring": "var(--jh-focus-accent)",
          "chart-1": "var(--jh-text)",
          "chart-2": "var(--jh-text-muted)",
          "chart-3": "var(--jh-text-faint)",
          "chart-4": "var(--jh-ink-faint)",
          "chart-5": "var(--jh-primary)",
          "radius": "var(--jh-radius)",
          "sidebar": "var(--jh-surface)",
          "sidebar-foreground": "var(--jh-text)",
          "sidebar-primary": "var(--jh-accent)",
          "sidebar-primary-foreground": "var(--jh-accent-contrast)",
          "sidebar-accent": "var(--jh-surface-strong)",
          "sidebar-accent-foreground": "var(--jh-text)",
          "sidebar-border": "var(--jh-border)",
          "sidebar-ring": "var(--jh-focus-accent)"
        },
        "dark": {
          "background": "var(--jh-invert-bg)",
          "foreground": "var(--jh-invert-text)",
          "card": "var(--jh-invert-surface)",
          "card-foreground": "var(--jh-invert-text)",
          "popover": "var(--jh-invert-surface)",
          "popover-foreground": "var(--jh-invert-text)",
          "primary": "var(--jh-invert-text)",
          "primary-foreground": "var(--jh-invert-bg)",
          "secondary": "var(--jh-invert-surface-strong)",
          "secondary-foreground": "var(--jh-invert-text)",
          "muted": "var(--jh-invert-surface-strong)",
          "muted-foreground": "var(--jh-invert-text-muted)",
          "accent": "var(--jh-invert-l3)",
          "accent-foreground": "var(--jh-invert-text)",
          "destructive": "var(--jh-status-alert)",
          "border": "var(--jh-invert-border)",
          "input": "var(--jh-invert-border-mid)",
          "ring": "var(--jh-primary)",
          "chart-1": "var(--jh-invert-text)",
          "chart-2": "var(--jh-invert-text-muted)",
          "chart-3": "var(--jh-invert-muted)",
          "chart-4": "var(--jh-invert-ink-faint)",
          "chart-5": "var(--jh-primary)",
          "sidebar": "var(--jh-invert-surface)",
          "sidebar-foreground": "var(--jh-invert-text)",
          "sidebar-primary": "var(--jh-primary)",
          "sidebar-primary-foreground": "var(--jh-invert-bg)",
          "sidebar-accent": "var(--jh-invert-l3)",
          "sidebar-accent-foreground": "var(--jh-invert-text)",
          "sidebar-border": "var(--jh-invert-border)",
          "sidebar-ring": "var(--jh-primary)"
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}
